{'symbol': 'BLK', 'date': '2022-12-16 17:04:00', 'title': 'BLACKROCK® CANADA CALLS UNITHOLDER MEETINGS OF CERTAIN ISHARES ETFS TO APPROVE PROPOSED MERGERS AND ANNOUNCES FEE REDUCTION', 'text': 'TORONTO, DEC. 16, 2022 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- BLACKROCK ASSET MANAGEMENT CANADA LIMITED (“BLACKROCK CANADA”), AN INDIRECT, WHOLLY-OWNED SUBSIDIARY OF BLACKROCK, INC. (“BLACKROCK”) (NYSE: BLK) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IT HAS CALLED SPECIAL MEETINGS OF UNITHOLDERS OF THE ISHARES EXCHANGE-TRADED FUNDS (“MERGING ETFS”) LISTED BELOW (THE “MEETINGS”), TO BE HELD ON OR ABOUT MARCH 1, 2023, SOLELY AS A VIRTUAL (ONLINE) MEETING BY WAY OF LIVE AUDIO WEBCAST, TO APPROVE THE MERGER OF EACH OF THE MERGING ETFS INTO THE APPLICABLE CONTINUING ISHARES EXCHANGE-TRADED FUNDS (“CONTINUING ETFS”), AS SET FORTH IN THE TABLE BELOW (THE “MERGERS”).'}